title: M1_RUNTIME_START
---
Narrator: M1 technical narrative-runtime smoke test has started.
<<jump M1_VARIABLES>>
===

title: M1_VARIABLES
---
<<declare $m1_selected_path = "unset">>
<<declare $m1_trust = 0>>
<<declare $m1_memory_seen = false>>
Narrator: Technical variables initialized. Select a smoke-test branch.
-> Select the kind test path
    <<jump M1_RUNTIME_KIND>>
-> Select the cautious test path
    <<jump M1_RUNTIME_CAUTIOUS>>
-> Select the silent test path
    <<jump M1_RUNTIME_SILENT>>
===

title: M1_RUNTIME_KIND
---
TestSpeaker: Kind path selected for runtime verification.
<<set $m1_selected_path = "kind">>
<<set $m1_trust = $m1_trust + 1>>
<<set $m1_memory_seen = true>>
<<jump M1_RUNTIME_RESULT>>
===

title: M1_RUNTIME_CAUTIOUS
---
TestSpeaker: Cautious path selected for runtime verification.
<<set $m1_selected_path = "cautious">>
<<set $m1_trust = $m1_trust + 2>>
<<set $m1_memory_seen = false>>
<<jump M1_RUNTIME_RESULT>>
===

title: M1_RUNTIME_SILENT
---
TestSpeaker: Silent path selected for runtime verification.
<<set $m1_selected_path = "silent">>
<<set $m1_trust = $m1_trust + 3>>
<<set $m1_memory_seen = true>>
<<jump M1_RUNTIME_RESULT>>
===

title: M1_RUNTIME_RESULT
---
<<if $m1_selected_path == "kind">>
Narrator: Technical result: kind branch; numeric and boolean values were updated.
<<elseif $m1_selected_path == "cautious">>
Narrator: Technical result: cautious branch; numeric and boolean values were updated.
<<else>>
Narrator: Technical result: silent branch; numeric and boolean values were updated.
<<endif>>
<<jump M1_RUNTIME_END>>
===

title: M1_RUNTIME_END
---
Narrator: M1 technical narrative-runtime smoke test complete.
===
